{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/Banner_Survive.png?t=1745000948\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/InitialGamePlay.gif?t=1745000948\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forge your Strategy\u00a0- </strong>Choose from over <strong>200+</strong> Augments to improve your campfire's abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unleash new Powers\u00a0</strong>- Unlock new <strong>Effects</strong> that significantly change how you battle during the night</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endure until Morning </strong>- Adapt your build and survive relentless waves of enemies until 6 AM</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/AugmentPickerOpt.gif?t=1745000948\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/Banner_Synergize.png?t=1745000948\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/CharacterSelect.gif?t=1745000948\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dominate the Fire\u00a0</strong>- Experiment with new combos with the <strong>30+</strong> Skills in <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/RowlIcon2.png?t=1745000948\" />\u00a0<strong>Rowl's Skill Tree</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Express yourself</strong> - Try all the unique <strong>40+</strong> Characters in<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/ClorisIcon.png?t=1745000948\" /><strong>Cloris' Wardrobe</strong>, each with unique playstyles<strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore new Habitats</strong> - Test your endurance by battling\u00a0across <strong>30+</strong> different environments and climates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200e \u200e \u200e \u200e \u200e \u200e \u200e \u200e \u200e \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/GamePlayShowcase.gif?t=1745000948\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/Banner_Explore.png?t=1745000948\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forge new Friendships</strong> - Socialize with other campers to discover new ways to strengthen your campfire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Become a Wildlife Specialist</strong> - Register all of the 60+ Species in\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/BetsyIcon.png?t=1745000948\" />\u00a0<strong>Betsy's Bestiary </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Haggle for Treasure</strong> - Strike deals for precious items and upgrades in\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651490/extras/NaalIcon.png?t=1745000948\" /><strong>Naal's Black Market </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unwind at the Campsite</strong> - Experience the camping life and enjoy the calm moments between battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leisure Time </strong>- Go to\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i